  "pass": "All 8 original slots must provide both an independently corroborated planner task exit and an acknowledged terminal sample with the dispatcher running. Both versions must seal on both real returns. Only v1 may seal on either volunteer cancellation. All 8 world effects and original verified rewards must match the declared case. Missing, conflicting, and unavailable evidence cannot pass.",
